        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as the little girl in the raincoat who is a master at jumping as you take on different themed levels. Each level features unique and challenging gimmicks as you attempt make your way to the top. Puddle is accompanied by an album of serene piano pieces, but it may not be so leisurely a time to complete each level. Luckily, there happens to be some strange birds to assist you on your way. Use their help to make it to the top and help the little girl make a splash.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as the little girl in the raincoat who is a master at jumping as you take on different themed levels. Each level features unique and challenging gimmicks as you attempt make your way to the top. Puddle is accompanied by an album of serene piano pieces, but it may not be so leisurely a time to complete each level. Luckily, there happens to be some strange birds to assist you on your way. Use their help to make it to the top and help the little girl make a splash.</p>",
